    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon\u2019s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon\u2019s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon\u2019s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon\u2019s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "DeAnima is a gripping modern dungeon crawler steeped in classic roguelike tradition. Battle to floor 10 to claim the Crown of Nivek and escape the cursed labyrinth - or dare to plunge deeper, risking all to unravel the ancient secrets buried in its shadowy depths.",
